{"id":"03be65ef075305b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-prop-ks-entropy.md","title":"Kolmogorov–Sinai Entropy","display":"prop-ks-entropy — Kolmogorov–Sinai Entropy","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-ks-entropy","aliases":["58-prop-ks-entropy"],"display":"prop-ks-entropy — Kolmogorov–Sinai Entropy","depends_on":["[[58-df-entropy]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-ks-entropy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-ks-entropy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ks-entropy — Kolmogorov–Sinai Entropy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc3b74121029112d\" href=\"?note=bc3b74121029112d\" title=\"58-df-entropy\">58-df-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bad3810e4165411\" href=\"?note=8bad3810e4165411\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy\">58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"835b897a70b3fbc9\" href=\"?note=835b897a70b3fbc9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition\">58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(h,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bad3810e4165411\" href=\"?note=8bad3810e4165411\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy\">58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\Sigma)\\)</span> is the measurable-partition predicate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\mu\">\\(H_\\mu\\)</span> is the partition-entropy operator from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc3b74121029112d\" href=\"?note=bc3b74121029112d\" title=\"58-df-entropy\">58-df-entropy</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\sigma(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> denotes the σ-algebra generated by a family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ks\\text{-}entropy}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land H_\\mu(\\alpha)&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\exists B\\in\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}T^{-k}\\alpha\\right)\\;\n\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\to h=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\nH_\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}T^{-i}\\alpha\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ks\\text{-}entropy}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land H_\\mu(\\alpha)&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\exists B\\in\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}T^{-k}\\alpha\\right)\\;\n\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\to h=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\nH_\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}T^{-i}\\alpha\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the Kolmogorov--Sinai generator theorem for a finite-entropy generating partition, with generation stated modulo null sets.  The former dependency named the infinitesimal generator of a Markov semigroup and belonged to a different mathematical domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b74121029112d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"8bad3810e4165411","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition","status":"resolved","id":"835b897a70b3fbc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"8bad3810e4165411","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b74121029112d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H_\\mu$ is the partition-entropy operator from [[58-df-entropy]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"h,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ks\\text{-}entropy}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land H_\\mu(\\alpha)<\\infty\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\exists B\\in\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}T^{-k}\\alpha\\right)\\;\n\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\\\\n&\\to h=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\nH_\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{i<n}T^{-i}\\alpha\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1695,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3973","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-prop-ks-entropy.md|58-prop-ks-entropy]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["bc3b74121029112d","8bad3810e4165411","835b897a70b3fbc9"]}